{"schemaVersion":1,"objectId":"stock300621","records":[{"id":"1802143786","objectId":"stock300621","title":"东易日盛怎末做到的","url":"https://guba.eastmoney.com/news,300621,1802143786.html","date":"2026-11-26","publishedAt":"2026-11-26 20:17:26","source":"东方财富股吧","readCount":20,"commentCount":0,"content":"","coverage":{"comments":"complete","fetchedComments":0,"body":"missing","reportedComments":0,"commentSource":"embedded-page","bodySource":"html-body","contentTruncated":false},"boardVerified":true,"nativeBoard":"300621","comments":[]},{"id":"1802069607","objectId":"stock300621","title":"维业股份这只股让我提起了兴趣，目前只有9.9亿市值，比很多st股的市值都要低，比","url":"https://guba.eastmoney.com/news,300621,1802069607.html","date":"2026-11-26","publishedAt":"2026-11-26 15:21:52","source":"东方财富股吧","readCount":1024,"commentCount":31,"content":"","coverage":{"comments":"partial","fetchedComments":10,"body":"missing","reportedComments":35,"commentSource":"public-web-and-child-pagination","bodySource":"html-body","contentTruncated":false,"commentError":"Repeated comment page; source did not paginate"},"boardVerified":true,"nativeBoard":"300621","comments":[{"id":"9984143306","text":"记得几年前创业板跌到4亿多市值就大涨那时候就关注你了，老粉丝了","at":"2026-11-26 22:26:37","replyTo":null},{"id":"9984078399","text":"按你说的，大盘看到3000点。这些低市值的会不会再杀一半市值呢？我记得你以前还按流动市值选股。立安科技怎么样呢？6000多股东流通市值只有五个亿了。明年中旬才解禁。","at":"2026-11-26 19:27:04","replyTo":null},{"id":"9984368723","text":"科技股还有很深的跌幅，看看当年的隆基就知道了，而低市值的股票下跌空间有限，跌不了多少了","at":"2026-11-27 12:19:27","replyTo":"9984078399"},{"id":"9984368092","text":"另外，科技股跌的时候，可能一天跌10个点，微盘股，一天只最多跌五六个点甚至只跌两三个点，微盘股跌的比科技少，涨得时候涨得不比科技少，一旦结束，低市值的股票是最先反弹的，很多低市值的股票都能涨一倍以上","at":"2026-11-27 12:17:52","replyTo":"9984078399"},{"id":"9984057380","text":"维业股份，可以叫做出货股份。出货绵绵无绝期，看着市值低，可能再跌一年。就问你敢不敢重仓。","at":"2026-11-26 18:32:29","replyTo":null},{"id":"9984144466","text":"错，我经常关注低市值，ST股等。但低市值为什么低？有些没有最低，只有更低。只能确认这底到了，才是真正的抄底时机。当然也可以守，重点要守多久？","at":"2026-11-26 22:30:26","replyTo":"9984057380"},{"id":"9984104144","text":"希望你去复盘一下历史上每年所有10亿左右的非st主板和创业板股票，看看他们后面的走势再来说活吧，你对低市值股票一无所知","at":"2026-11-26 20:35:04","replyTo":"9984057380"},{"id":"9984052006","text":"之前百邦科技最低6.9。涨到48.48","at":"2026-11-26 18:19:00","replyTo":null},{"id":"9984099053","text":"低市值长线必涨","at":"2026-11-26 20:21:05","replyTo":"9984052006"},{"id":"9983997021","text":"楼主可以看看自由流通市值，启迪设计只有5亿出头，是这三个里面最小的。此外目前的成交量感觉也是三个里面最活跃的。不过明天大叶估计会开板，可择机逢低吸纳。","at":"2026-11-26 16:18:45","replyTo":null}]},{"id":"1801905532","objectId":"stock300621","title":"不能买，自己开的债权凭证拒不付款，工程款不给钱用房子抵债，财务情况一塌糊","url":"https://guba.eastmoney.com/news,300621,1801905532.html","date":"2026-11-26","publishedAt":"2026-11-26 13:36:38","source":"东方财富股吧","readCount":35,"commentCount":1,"content":"","coverage":{"comments":"unknown","fetchedComments":0,"body":"missing","reportedComments":1,"commentSource":"public-web-and-child-pagination","bodySource":"html-body","contentTruncated":false},"boardVerified":true,"nativeBoard":"300621","comments":[]},{"id":"1801689693","objectId":"stock300621","title":"维业股份：订单修复还要穿越低毛利","url":"https://guba.eastmoney.com/news,300621,1801689693.html","date":"2026-11-26","publishedAt":"2026-11-26 10:05:34","source":"东方财富股吧","readCount":73,"commentCount":0,"content":"","coverage":{"comments":"complete","fetchedComments":0,"body":"missing","reportedComments":0,"commentSource":"embedded-page","bodySource":"html-body","contentTruncated":false},"boardVerified":true,"nativeBoard":"300621","comments":[]},{"id":"1801656207","objectId":"stock300621","title":"快跑吧，银行股又开始拉涨了啊","url":"https://guba.eastmoney.com/news,300621,1801656207.html","date":"2026-11-26","publishedAt":"2026-11-26 09:51:09","source":"东方财富股吧","readCount":16,"commentCount":0,"content":"","coverage":{"comments":"complete","fetchedComments":0,"body":"missing","reportedComments":0,"commentSource":"embedded-page","bodySource":"html-body","contentTruncated":false},"boardVerified":true,"nativeBoard":"300621","comments":[]}]}
